  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Figure A6.1, the OpenHIE architecture. The OpenHIE component layer holds business domain services (logistics management information service, shared health record, health management information service, finance and insurance service) and registry services (terminology services, client registry, facility registry, health worker registry, product catalogue). Below it the interoperability services layer is a green 'Interoperability Layer' band with authentication, interlinking service and entity mapping. Along the bottom, point-of-service systems: mobile system, electronic medical record, health management information system, lab system, pharmacy system, logistics management information system, and finance and insurance system. Credited 'OpenHIE 2020-05-28; CC BY 4.0'. The page's footnote says orange boxes mark the registries and repositories relevant to DDCC:VS; no orange marking is visible in this extracted image.",
